            "review_text": "Taj_Grill54c\nNha Trang, Vietnam1 contribution\n1\nGreat food ever!!!!!!\nNov 2018 • Couples\nI passed this restaurant from my friend recommended. The food is unique and the tasty is so delicious.\nTheir menu has a lot of kind different but the especial dish here is black chicken stream with herb.\nBesides that you can try steam beef or Vietnamese rice. \nI recommend everyone come to try when you come to Nha Trang if you feel boring seafood and want to try really unique food\nRead more\nWritten November 2, 2018",
